WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:04.254
You’re a devoted wife...

00:00:04.921 --> 00:00:06.297
and mom...

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:10.593
and know everything

00:00:10.593 --> 00:00:13.013
about those closest to you.

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:14.764
But the truth is,

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:17.434
everyone has a secret.

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:25.608
Even you.

